      "content": "The Defense Visual Information Distribution Service (DVIDS) API provides programmatic access to U.S. military news, photos, video, audio, publications, units, and live events. The API is implemented as JSON over HTTP and requires a public API key.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: DVIDS",
